  "title": "Variant type mismatch is a normal error",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Variant type mismatch is a normal error",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "A boxed String cannot be extracted as I32. The result is the I32 intrinsic default and an error status; no numeric parsing or reinterpretation is attempted. Native and historical Simulation currently have distinct error codes, so this example compares the shared status and data behavior.\n\nA boxed String cannot be extracted as I32. The result is the I32 intrinsic default and an error status; no numeric parsing or reinterpretation is attempted. Native and historical Simulation currently have distinct error codes, so this example compares the shared status and data behavior.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: studio.native.composed@1.\nExpected:\nresult (i32) = 0\nerror-status (bool) = true\n",
    "author": "",
    "automatic_versioning": false,
    "program_version": "0.0.0.0",
